Package: org.rustica.imageviewer
Version: 1.0.3
Architecture: x86_64
Kind: app
Maintainer: The Rustux Authors <gitrustux@rustux>
Homepage: https://rustux.com
License: MIT
Description: Image Viewer
 Rustica's Image Viewer: a PNG or JPEG picture, made smaller to fit the
 window. Files opens a picture with it; it needs no permission to your
 folders.
